  "steps": [
    "Add the almond milk, cacao powder, maple syrup, cinnamon, vanilla and salt to a medium saucepan and whisk until no dry cacao remains.",
    "Warm over medium heat, whisking occasionally, until steaming with small bubbles at the edge, about 5 min. Do not let it boil.",
    "Taste and add more maple syrup if you want it sweeter.",
    "Pour into 2 large mugs and top with coconut whipped cream, marshmallows and chopped dark chocolate, if using."
